        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "マユリヤさんは茶器を手にして嬉しそうに微笑むと、\n机に並べて言った。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "a1192996d33298c4435b28c68ee7bae0ba6e9e93f54793ada94a1b91f4b15b53",
